"gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/1xch","html_url":"https://github.com/1xch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1xch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1xch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1xch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1xch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1xch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1xch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1xch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1xch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1xch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-05T13:10:58Z","updated_at":"2025-03-05T13:10:58Z","body":"I actually want to reopen in this because on tracing through I found the one thing that makes a difference. \n\nThe last thing loaded is a theme resource e.g.\n\n```\nconst _fallback_theme:Theme = preload(\"res://addons/pxpxp/resources/themes/pxpxp_default_theme.tres\")\n```\n\nand when commenting this out, everything goes through as normal. So the issue seems to be with preloading a theme within a resource being loaded in another thread. I know its not much, I'll see if I can replicate it with a smaller sample, and maybe it ties into something else being reported. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2700890850/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2700893294","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103579#issuecomment-2700893294","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103579","id":2700893294,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6g_Fxu","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-05T13:11:57Z","updated_at":"2025-03-05T13:11:57Z","body":"We would need the place it is used as well and more context for that","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2700893294/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2701060313","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103579#issuecomment-2701060313","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103579","id":2701060313,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6g_ujZ","user":{"login":"1xch","id":199137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5OTEzNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/1xch","html_url":"https://github.com/1xch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1xch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1xch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1xch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1xch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1xch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1xch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1xch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1xch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/1xch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-05T14:10:54Z","updated_at":"2025-03-05T16:04:43Z","body":"I was going to try and replicate it but it would take my day. But here is a nonworking sketch of whats happening.\n\n1. ZWOAD._z_get_worker attempts to load a resource by name, in this case a resource extending PXPXP\n\n2. runs a number WorkerThreadPool tasks corresponding to file/path objects it has, until finding it \n\n3. when finding it, awaits LL.LOAD which itself runs a WorkerThreadPool task\n\n4. while this is happening, app will lock up if \n\n\t````\n\tconst _fallback_theme:Theme = preload(\"res://addons/pxpxp/resources/themes/pxpxp_default_theme.tres\")\n\t````\n\n\tis uncommented\n\t\n\t\nSo, preloading a theme within several layers of abstraction locks the app. But there is another preload several lines before the supposed offending one (not a theme, just a more regular script). It was working, but this is all a non production, development, untested situation and perhaps even more a confusing mess without much of the context. \n\nPerhaps its is something useful to point out here as a potential bug that links to other reports, perhaps it is something I need to cleanup \n\n[preload-chokes.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19090415/preload-chokes.zip)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2701060313/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]